ice of the cabalistic art, natural and celestial magic, &c.; shewing the wonderful effects that may be performed by a knowledge of the celestial influences, the occult properties of metals, herbs, and stones, and the application of active to passive principles exhibiting the sciences of natural magic; alchymy, or hermetic philosophy; also the nature, creation, and fall of man; his natural and supernatural gifts; the magical power inherent in the soul, &c.;  ... by Francis Barrett, F.R.C. Professor of chemistry ...  aLondon: Lackington & Allen & C.d1801  axv, 175, 198 p., 1 ritratto, 21 carte di tav.cill.d4°  a1 v.5IT-IT-MI0185       , ECO.      01.                     0480  aGBdLondra3MUSL001931 1aBarrettb, Francis3LO1V25170902aLackington & Allen & C.3FERV076415465002aAllen & Lackington & C.3FERV076422zLackington & Allen & C. 3aITbIT-000000c20220517  aIT-MI0185        0aBiblioteca nazionale Braidensec1 v. - Ex libris Umberto Eco sul recto della carta di guardia. - Altro ex libris sul contropiatto ant.d NBECO.      01.                     0480e NB8  9000030855  VMA                       1 v.fM h20220518i20220518lSala manoscrittimSala manoscritti  a NB02230nam0 22004213i MILE06271520260907054905.0  ai.o- u-n- n-I. rafu (C) 1666 (R)2fei  a20220512d1666    ||||0itac50      ba| alat  ade 16z01ai bxxxe   16z01an 16z01anc2RDAcarrier1 aQ.D.B.V. Exercitium academicum, circa praescientiam daemonum expendendam occupatum, quod ... in illustri salana, sub praesidio ... Dn. M. Johannis Christophori Hundeshagen ... publicae disquisitioni subiicit Dietericus Lüders Stadensis, mense Augusto H.L.Q.C.   aJenaectypis Johannis Jacobi Bauhofferid1666  a[16] carted4°  aCfr: VD17  aSegnatura: A-D⁴  aLegatura in tela. - Ex libris sul contropiatto anteriore.5IT-IT-MI0185       , ECO.      01.                     0669  aPossessore: Eco, Umberto. 5IT-MI0185        ECO. 01. 0669  aDEdJena3MILL001586 1aH