1 a[7]: Epistola anatomica, problematica sexta. Authore Johanne Henrico Graetz, ad virum clarissimum Fredericum Ruyschium ... De arteria & vena bronchiali, nec non de polypis bronchiorum ejectis, venae & arteriae pulmonalis ramos mentientibusv7 11001UBOE07835812001 a[12]: Epistola anatomica, problematica, undecima, authore Joh. Christian. Wolf, Anhaltin. M.L. ad virum clarissimum Fredericum Ruyschium ... de intestinorum tunicis, glandulis, &cv12 11001UBOE07836612001 a[15]: Epistola anatomica, problematica, quarta & decima. Authore Mauritio à Reverhorst ... Ad virum clarissimum Fredericum Ruyschium, de nova artuum decurtandorum methodov15 11001UBOE12423712001 a[23]: Frederici Ruyschii ... Thesaurus animalium primus. Cum figuris aeneisv23 11001UBOE12426912001 a[41]: Opusculum anatomicum de fabrica glandularum in corpore humano, continens binas epistolas, quarum prior est Hermanni Boerhaave, super hac re, ad Fredericum Ruyschium; altera Frederici Ruyschii ad Hermannum Boerhaave qua priori respondeturv41 11001USME02424212001 a[1]: Historia vitae et meritorum Frederici Ruysch. Auctore Ioanne Friderico Schreiberov1 11001USME02424412001 a[2]: Frederici Ruyschii ... Dilucidatio valvularum in vasis lymphaticis, et lacteis ... Accesserunt quaedam observationes anatomicae rarioresv2 11001USME02424512001 a[3]: Frederici Ruyschii ... Observationum anatomico-chirurgicarum centuria. Accedit Catalogus rariorum, quae in  Museo Ruyschiano asservantur ...v3 11001USME02424812001 a[33]: Frederici Ruyschii ... Thesaurus magnus & regius qui est decimus thesaurorum anatomicorum. In quo præcipuæ corporis humani partes, ceu in statu vivo, nitidissime præparatæ, reservantur ...v33 11001USME02424912001 a[34]: Frederici Ruyschii ... Curæ posteriores, seu Thesaurus anatomicus omnium præcedentium maximus ...v34 11001USME02425012001 a[35]: Frederici Ruyschii ... Curae renovatae, seu, Thesaurus anatomicus, post Curas posteriores, novus ...v35 11001USME02425112001 a[36]: Tractatio anatomica, de musculo, in fundo uteri observato, antehac a nemine detecto, cui, accedit depulsionis secundinarum, parturientium foeminarum, instructio, authore Frederico Ruyschio ... Ex Belgico in Latinum traducta, a Joanne Christophoro Bohlio ...v36 11001USME02425312001 a[37]: Io. Christoph. Bohlii ... Dissertatio epistolica. Ad virum clarissimum, Fredericum Ruyschium ... de usu nouarum cavæ propaginum in systemate chylopoeo, ut & de corticis crebri texturav37 11001USME02425412001 a[38]: Frederici Ruyschii ... Responsio, ad Dissertationem epistolicam, viri doctissimi, Joh. Christoph. Bohlii ... quam, de usu novarum cavae propaginum in systemate chylopoeo, nec non de cortice cerebri, conscripsit ...v38 11001USME02425612001 a[39]: Epistola viri clarissimi Hecqueti, ad D.D.    . De Ruyschiano uteri musculov39 11001USME02425712001 a[40]: Abrahami Vateri, d. et p.p. anat, et botan ... socii. Epistola gratulatoria. Ad virum vere illustrem, dominum celeberrimum Fredericum Ruyschium ... in qua de musculo orbiculari in fundo uteri detecto gratulatur simulque communicationem eorum quae noviter in anatomia plantarum detexit perquam officiose sibi expetit dubiumque exponit circa lacunas uteri gravidiv40 11001USME02425812001 a[41]: Opusculum anatomicum de fabrica glandularum in corpore humano, continens binas epistolas, quarum prior est Hermanni Boerhaave, super hac re, ad Fredericum Ruyschium; altera Frederici Ruyschii ad Hermannum Boerhaave qua priori respondeturv41 11001USME02425912001 a[42]: Frederici Ruyschii, M.D. anatomes & botanices professoris ... Operum anatomico-medico-chirurgicorum index locupletissimus, concinnatus ab Ysbrando Gysberto Arlebout ...v42 11001USME02426012001 a[43]: Appendix necessaria, indicis locupletissimi, operum anatomico-medico-chirurgicorum Frederici Ruyschii ... in qua notantur res, quae in Opusculo anatomico, de fabrica glandularum in corpore humano, ab Hermanno Boerhaave et Frederico Ruyschio conscripto, tractanturv43 11001USME02649712001 a[5]: Epistola anatomica, problematica quarta, ad virum clarissimum Fredericum Ruyschium ..., de glandulis, fibris, cellulisque lienalibus, &c. Auctore Joh. Jac. Campdomercov5 11001USME02662112001 a[6]: Epistola anatomica, problematica quinta, auctore Gerardo Frentz, M.D. ad virum clarissimum Fredericum Ruyschium ... de vasis sanguiferis periostii tibiæ, ut &  viis, per quas vesicula fellea sarcinam acquiritv6 11001USME02662212001 a[7]: Epistola anatomica, problematica sexta. Authore Johanne Henrico Grætz, ad virum clarissimum Fredericum Ruyschium ... De arteria & vena bronchiali, nec non de polypis bronchiorum ejectis, venæ & arteriæ pulmonalis ramos mentientibusv7 11001USME02662312001 a[8]: Epistola anatomica, problematica septima. Authore Johanne Henrico Grætz, ad virum clarissimum Fredericum Ruyschium ... De pia matre, ejusque processibusv8 11001USME02662412001 a[9]: Epistola anatomica, problematica octava. Authore Johanne Henrico Grætz, ad virum clarissimum Fredericum Ruyschium ... De structura nasi cartilaginea, vasis sanguiferis arteriosis membranæ & cavitatis tympani & ossiculorum auditus eorumque periostiov9 11001USME02662512001 a[10]: Epistola anatomica, problematica nona. Authore Andrea Ottomaro Goelicke, Med. D. ad virum clarissimum Fredericum Ruyschium ... De cursu arteriarum per piam matrem cerebrum involventem, de tertia cerebri meninge, de arteriis membranarum cavitates ossis frontis supra narium radices & eas sub sella equina investientium, nec non de vasis arteriosis novis hepatis & diaphragmatisv10 11001USME02662612001 a[11]: Epistola anatomica, problematica decima, auctore Bartholomæo Keerwolff, Med. Doct. ad virum clarissimum Fredericum Ruyschium ... de auricularum cordis, earumque fibrarum motricum structurav11 11001USME02662712001 a[12]: Epistola anatomica, problematica, undecima, authore Joh. Christian. Wolf, Anhaltin. M.L. ad virum clarissimum Fredericum Ruyschium ... de intestinorum tunicis, glandulis, &cv12 11001USME02662812001 a[13]: Epistola anatomica, problematica, duodecima, authore Mich. Ernesto Ettmullero, M.D. &c. ad virum clarissimum Fredericum Ruyschium ... de cerebri corticali substantia, &cv13 11001USME02662912001 a[14]: Epistola anatomica, problematica tertia & decima. Authore Christiano Wedelio, ad virum clarissimum Fredericum Ruyschium ... De oculorum tunicisv14 11001USME02663112001 a[15]: Epistola anatomica, problematica, quarta & decima. Authore Mauritio à Reverhorst ... Ad virum clarissimum Fredericum Ruyschium, de nova artuum decurtandorum methodov15 11001USME02663312001 a[16]: Epistola anatomica, problematica, quinta & decima. Auctore Alberto Henrico Grætz. Ad virum clarissimum Fredericum Ruyschium ... De vasorum sanguineorum extremitatibus, placentæ uterinæ, mammarumque structura, &cv16 11001USME02663412001 a[17]: Epistola anatomica, problematca decima et sexta, ad virum illustrem Fredericum Ruyschium ... De viis absconditis pulmonum, quibus aër, respirando receptus, in sanguinem penetrat; nec non de vasorum secretoriorum structura mechanica, & de fibrillarum nervearum in cerebro principiis. Authore M. Abrahamo Vatero ...v17 11001USME02663512001 a[18]: Frederici Ruyschii Responsio ad Godefridi Bidloi libellum, quem vindicias inscripsitv18 11001USME02663612001 a[19]: Joannis Jacobi Rau Responsio ad qualemcunque defensionem Frederici Ruyschii, quam haud ita pridem edidit, pro septo scroti. In qua hujus litis anatomicæ detegitur origo: et septum scroti, ab ipso descriptum & delineatum, fictitium esse, clare demonstratur. Adjuncta est hujus calci auctoris epistolav19 11001USME02664512001 a[20]: Frederici Ruyschii ... Adversariorum anatomico-medico-chirurgicorum decas prima. In quâ varia notatu digna recensetur cum figuris æneis, cui adjuncta est Michaelis Ernesti Etmulleri Epistola problematica ad V.C. Fred. Ruyschium de ovario novov20 11001USME02664812001 a[21]: Frederici Ruyschii ... Adversariorum anatomico-medico-chirurgicorum decas secunda; in quâ varia notatu digna recensentur. Cum figuris æneisv21 11001USME02664912001 a[22]: Frederici Ruyschii ... Adversariorum anatomico-medico-chirurgicorum decas tertia. In qua varia notatur digna recensentur. Cum figuris æneisv22 11001USME02665012001 a[4]: Johannis Gaubii Epistola problematica, prima, ad virum clarissimum Fredericum Ruyschium ... De pilis, pinguedine, septoque scroti; nec non de papillis piramidalibus; ut & de corpore reticulari, sub cuticula sito, &cv4 11001USME02666212001 a[38]: Frederici Ruyschii ... Responsio, ad Dissertationem epistolicam, viri doctissimi, Joh. Christoph. Bohlii ... quam, de usu novarum cavæ propaginum in systemate chylopoeo, nec non de cortice cerebri, conscripsit ...v38 11001USME02666412001 a[40]: Abrahami Vateri ... Epistola gratulatoria. Ad virum vere illustrem, dominum celeberrimum Fredericum Ruyschium ... in qua de musculo orbiculari in fundo vteri detecto gratulatur simulque communicationem eorum quæ noviter in anatomia plantarum detexit perquam officiose sibi expetit dubiumque exponit circa lacunas vteri gravidiv401 aFr. Ruyschii Opera omnia.9USME024261  aNLdAmsterdam3BVEL000108 1aRuyschb, Frederikf <1638-1731>3PUVV1527804070 1aHuybertsb, Cornelisf <1669-ca. 1712>3USMV63988102aJanssonius van Waesberge3UBOV1182904650 1aHuybertb, Cornelisf <1669-ca. 1712>3BVEV133256zHuyberts, Cornelis <1669-ca. 1712> 1aHuybersb, Cornelisf <1669-ca. 1712>3BVEV133257zHuyberts, Cornelis <1669-ca. 1712>02aWaesberge3UBOV126993zJanssonius van Waesberge02aWaesberge Janson3USMV607464zJanssonius van Waesberge02aJanssonius van Waesberge Officina3VEAV056030zJanssonius van Waesberge02aJansson van Waesberge3VEAV056031zJanssonius van Waesberge02aJanssonio-Waesbergii3VEAV056032zJansson